<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-22T13:58:26.528Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 13:58:26 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen in Plateau killed NSCDC officer Distu Garba Audu and abducted a businessman, while bandits in Kaduna abducted five people, including a one-month-old baby, and demanded N10 million for a teacher's release. Troops rescued four abducted victims in Zamfara and Kebbi and police freed a Catholic priest and seven other abductees in Benue. Bandits killed passengers in road attacks in Sokoto and intercepted a vehicle, killing all passengers, and herders in Plateau were attacked, leaving two dead and six injured. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/eye-on-africa/20261021-sudan-s-war-escalates-as-un-warns-of-wider-regional-crisis&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxPVXItNmFOcy1xTnAzMnJzNXpXQ193ZWZSWGp4U0tPVGd4Slc5aS02Zk5EYUtTbmJRemNqczhVdEdzTzYtQndLWEVHaUZjTHhZZFA5alFhZV9aX3NZdE1LcTBIb2huR1JWWnlPX3JGdDltZTAxODlGZ012T0doQmlZQlBoWFFIMTl1d3dVRElCQVNmMXpqeXRDRkNoZEEyaFJrZUlEWWFkUklXdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxQMllNZ1EwTGxORXZjV1ZmczkwYXhnMXp0ZngySFpLOWtOVlVQUmRzYWJpdXVHYkp2MUVKYThJVUE3NEhraWJid1Z0eDNFb3JHbm81NUp2T2oybUNxNl92U3FDUDRUZVdXbjNiY0k2YnphaDVwbTROQmQ0akRYbkZEYlJDQ21SdUJBb3Z1S1RHTlVXMHd1TWlRV2o2UTZzTW8?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Post Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxQQmZMcm41MzdyR0FuVElkVGFRUmU2UEcxb2JWTEttakZVcTFGQXRfeGdnZkVQVnlMWFRodG9iMUNQYUhoX0E3SjEwY3lsR1I3OTVHTk9nT29HQVplUXhwREJoTHQ0eDRLR3djT1luSG9NNG1TSjdSRUYzVzVMNzJ1YVVMQU1yYjZINE44?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Eagle Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxOazQ2U2J0N0J5cHNzMzNFLVh2R3pvNWhaSTdpalpSNzhRemhtakVxZDV6THhU